{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dd91585209359366ee81b2217622e939a8f9b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a: b$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/9611a10934d20932453450ad8990985b21a1363e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; a &lt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/443f7fae6516d94077957537382416192d17ea3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, then the smaller of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a6c627569e1ae7ab31a9077eb54f0b212cfaa73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac{ac}{b} \\qquad  \\text{(B)} \\ \\frac{bc-ac}{b} \\qquad  \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac{ac}{a+b} \\qquad  \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{bc}{a+b}\\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{ac}{b-a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"495\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write 2 equations.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/e/16e243d14146001fb3bffd649f5a95c04001b94d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44ea3216d3cb6a8de6ab1597b92e573f02bd1acc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> we get&#160;:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7f8a3ce4f3003766c515f2528edf2d3a6852a83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{ac}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/967544280b98e89687ce9151525672e4406d6ef8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{bc}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Since we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63a02e990af0472bb18b97bdcac91d923a867ccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{bc}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"80\" height=\"41\" />, the smaller of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c65c144d12af4ceb787f5a1beb9ebd34899deee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{ac}{a+b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"90\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>~superagh\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td 